msgid "**U5 - High Voltage Protection**"
msgstr "U5 - 高压保护"

#: ../../procedure/inspection.rst:35 fc4c38ab4ad0456a9fe70364327ec129
#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid ""
"The spacing between the tips does not comply with soldering guidelines and "
"could potentially lead to short circuits. Therefore, a 100% short-circuit "
"test must be performed by the PCB manufacturer. Any problems that arise must"
" be resolved immediately with the supplier."
msgstr "焊嘴间距不符合焊接规范，可能导致短路。因此，PCB制造商必须进行100%短路测试。任何出现的问题都必须立即与供应商协商解决。"

#: ../../procedure/inspection.rst:40 4f16882959a142bdb164b4e6cc03620e
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fig.: U5 passive high voltage protection"
msgstr "图：U5 无源高压保护"

#: ../../procedure/inspection.rst:42 2788319699784b7eb8c6e492311fb71a
#, fuzzy
msgid "**Q3 - Hall sensor**"
msgstr "**Q3 - 霍尔传感器**"

#: ../../procedure/inspection.rst:44 5cb82314efd54016ac9c0e3ebabec2d7
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The spacing between the pins on Q3 is very tight. If Q3 is manually "
"populated as an option, high-quality soldering is required there. Q3 is not "
"normally populated."
msgstr "Q3引脚间距非常小。如果手动安装Q3引脚（可选），则需要高质量的焊接。Q3通常不安装任何元件。"

#: ../../procedure/inspection.rst:49 0a84ec29a5db48ac8631655e7e6c189e
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fig.: Q3 pin spacing"
msgstr "图：Q3引脚间距"

#: ../../procedure/inspection.rst:51 1201b0b5a2ee42a58be612824834ba4a
#, fuzzy
msgid "**U2 - Micro Controller**"
msgstr "U2 - 微控制器"

#: ../../procedure/inspection.rst:53 d09821ed379b459c9c76ed0557158ead
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"U2 must not mismatch the solder pads. All pins must be evenly and centered "
"on the solder pads. The WiFi antenna must not protrude beyond the board."
msgstr "U2的焊盘必须对齐。所有引脚必须均匀且居中地位于焊盘上。WiFi天线不得超出电路板边缘。"

